### Page 1 of 3

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

September 20, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-3-24 for furnishing Loose Equipment for Five (5) Fire
Apparatus, for the Cheyenne Fire Rescue department.
 ______________________________________________
Bid #E-3-24 was solicited for furnishing Loose Equipment for Five (5) Fire Apparatus, for the
Cheyenne Fire Rescue department.

One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bid was received
from:
1. Front Range Fire Apparatus (Colorado).

The bid was reviewed by John Fitzgerald (CFR) and John Kopper (CFR) and their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Front Range Fire Apparatus.

The total Bid Award amount is $411,648.63

Funding:
032-16-1640-41-43106 (SPOT / Fire Trucks - 2021 Ballot)
020-26-2612-41-43102 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Equipment)
```

